# ============================================================
# 跑步模拟器 / RunSimulator — GitHub 上传排除规则
# 仓库只提交源码、构建脚本、测试与文档；APK 由 GitHub Actions
# 编译后附加到 Release。逐项说明见 GITHUB_RELEASE_GUIDE.md。
# ============================================================

# --- Android / Gradle 构建产物 -------------------------------
.gradle/
**/build/
.kotlin/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
*.hprof
lint-results*.xml
lint-results*.html

# 本地 SDK 路径、签名与密钥（严禁提交）-----------------------
local.properties
keystore.properties
signing.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
secrets.properties

# --- 随附的本地 Android SDK / 工具链（约 727 MB）-------------
.tools/
.tools-location-reference.html
reference-readme.txt
audit-hashes.txt

# --- CI / 发布产物 -------------------------------------------
# dist 只保留说明文件；APK、idsig、源码 zip、测试截图不进入仓库。
dist/*
!dist/README.md

# --- Python 控制台 keep-data-sim-main ------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
*.egg-info/
keep-data-sim-main/outputs/
keep-data-sim-main/test_data/

# 生成的轨迹 / 运动数据文件
*.gpx
*.fit
*.tcx

# --- 测试与临时文件 ------------------------------------------
test-results/
playwright-report/
node_modules/
*.log
*.tmp
tmp/
temp/
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# --- IDE / 操作系统 ------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
